Legal Operations KPI List

A practical set of key performance indicators for Legal Operations, grouped by area. Start with a handful per category rather than tracking everything: pick the metrics that match your department's current priorities and the data you can reliably collect.

How to Use This List
• Pick 2-4 KPIs per category that tie directly to your department's goals.
• Set a baseline first, then targets. A KPI without a baseline is just a number.
• Separate leading from lagging indicators. Cycle times and intake volume predict problems; spend and outcomes confirm them.
• Report to the right audience. The GC and CFO care about spend, risk and value; legal team leads care about workload and turnaround.

