Suggested Starter Dashboard
If you are building a first dashboard, these ten KPIs give a balanced view:
1.  Total legal spend and % of revenue
2.  Budget vs. actual variance
3.  Outside counsel invoice reduction rate
4.  Blended hourly rate
5.  Request response and cycle time
6.  Contract cycle time
7.  % of contracts on standard paper
